TRIVIA 
Details: DUNK has never been officially confirmed dead, despite numerous premature reports concerning his apparent demise. His crimson lenses are entirely conventional and possess no supernatural properties. DUNK’s actual nationality remains unknown, partly because he rarely provides consistent answers when questioned about it. The single American state from which he is not banned remains undisclosed. His reputation for unarmed brutality has resulted in the expression that giving DUNK a firearm constitutes a humanitarian gesture. Some Roanapur establishments allegedly maintain separate financial reserves for damages associated with his visits. DUNK occasionally refers to satellite surveillance as his international fan club. He possesses considerably better culinary abilities than most individuals expect. His confinement to Roanapur is not a conventional prison sentence and possesses no established expiration date. American authorities have reportedly expended considerably more resources returning DUNK to Roanapur than DUNK has personally spent travelling. He is capable of being surprisingly pleasant company, although this provides no reliable indication of how an afternoon with him will conclude. DUNK considers his repeated return to Roanapur evidence of the American government’s exceptional hospitality.
